  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A light string passing over a smooth light fixed pulley connects two blocks of masses <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>. If the acceleration of the system is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math>, then the ratio of masses is</p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4af58996-9779-4414-9f9e-d7b3cab5b774.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 193px;\"/>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "zdYiH",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t8hv2",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "8QFDb",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "6HktJ",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Acceleration of the system can be written as, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>g</mi></mrow><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>8</mn><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
